A bounded source of untrusted point-cycle hints
==============================================

The unchanged direct consumer checks actual edges of supplied distinct closed
11- and13-cycles in words of the two original rotations. Its conditional
Fi22 generation conclusion uses the retained simple-group maximal-order
theorem and the complete original model/member/Reader/bridge/action/class,
normality, global block2 class, two-fibre and H=B premises. This supplier
imports those same exact identities solely to choose candidate traces; it
proves no generation, IP, reversal, census, whole manuscript or group-model
claim. The direct consumer and a separate Root adoption remain necessary.

The schedule is a fixed list of64 signed words of length at most6, built
from freely and cyclically reduced words modulo cyclic shift and inversion.
Only the selected spellings at original starts0,1,2,3 are tried. This
selection is an untrusted search heuristic: equivalent spellings need not
have identical success at one fixed point. No completeness or absence
conclusion is inferred from an exhausted schedule.

A trial follows at most13 consecutive images of one original point under
one word, using the literal whole-framed original operands and the retained
kernel. The virtual middle element is evaluated as three conjugate d0
factors. No3510-entry virtual middle permutation, group orbit, SGS,
classifier, full order or model construction is computed. Only a first
return of length11 or13 becomes a hint; all open or other short traces
are unpaid misses. Every final direct proof checks all closing edges again.

The window is an exact original free-row interval of length at most16.
Only cases whose finite trial queue completed or acquired both hints are
visited. At a soft stop, the current partial trace and every remaining
case are unvisited, never paid. The output records partition the selected
window into pair hints, unpaid finite misses and unvisited positions.
An explicit next checkpoint may reuse its completed cursor prefixes and
hints as untrusted data. The interrupted current trial restarts, since an
interruption can occur inside one word image. No unverified partial edge
or skipped cursor acquires proof authority. Even a syntactically valid but
false inherited hint must be rejected by the separate strict consumer.

All setup/configuration and physical reads are charged in shared Work
from module START, including current Source bootstrap and final fresh
whole hashes. The supplier differs explicitly from the frozen consumer's
narrower mathematical Work start. A proposing SearchWork checks its6M
unit,14second and112MiB reserve before each charge; its effective unit
cap is also reduced by the exact final-read bytes and all output reserves.
The unchanged hard shared10M/20seconds and ordinary128MiB/140seconds
remain in force; the outer Root supervisor retains512MiB/150seconds.
No claim is made that16 entire schedules finish within one invocation.
The exact diagnostic checkpoint enables small bounded progress instead.

Every input has its complete stable canonical single-link descriptor;
first and final fresh reads, interpreter Source bootstrap, actual future
Root/control/review roles and optional checkpoint stay within8MiB/32paths.
The compiler uses only the exact whole6729-byte retained pure kernel at its
